  "captions": [
    {
      "start": 0.18382978723404253,
      "end": 2.861489361702128,
      "text": "Alice runs a bakery using Muse."
    },
    {
      "start": 2.928510638297873,
      "end": 6.042340425531916,
      "text": "Bob is her customer and uses Wajo."
    },
    {
      "start": 6.120000000000001,
      "end": 8.42531914893617,
      "text": "They already know who they want to contact."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.737021276595744,
      "end": 12.322765957446807,
      "text": "Let's see how their agents connect, including when the bakery"
    },
    {
      "start": 12.332765957446806,
      "end": 13.584893617021276,
      "text": "contacts Bob."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.917163120567375,
      "end": 17.84333333333333,
      "text": "Alice pastes the setup prompt into Muse using her bakery"
    },
    {
      "start": 17.85333333333333,
      "end": 18.658652482269503,
      "text": "email."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.72567375886525,
      "end": 22.705035460992907,
      "text": "Her agent follows the website instructions and prepares its agent"
    },
    {
      "start": 22.715035460992908,
      "end": 23.33950354609929,
      "text": "box."
    },
    {
      "start": 23.683829787234043,
      "end": 27.063617021276595,
      "text": "Bob does the same in Wajo with his own email."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.130638297872338,
      "end": 30.563617021276595,
      "text": "His agent can run in a different app from Alice's."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.917163120567377,
      "end": 34.59482269503546,
      "text": "Each person enters the code sent to their own inbox."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.66184397163121,
      "end": 37.828865248226954,
      "text": "The code proves control of that email account."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.8958865248227,
      "end": 40.5522695035461,
      "text": "The example code on screen is fictional."
    },
    {
      "start": 40.88382978723404,
      "end": 43.62531914893617,
      "text": "Bob already knows bakery.com."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.69234042553192,
      "end": 46.94446808510639,
      "text": "He asks his agent, \"Ask at bakery.com."
    },
    {
      "start": 47.01148936170213,
      "end": 48.73170212765958,
      "text": "What cakes are available?\""
    },
    {
      "start": 49.083829787234045,
      "end": 52.59510638297873,
      "text": "In this example, the bakery has published its agents contact"
    },
    {
      "start": 52.605106382978725,
      "end": 54.421063829787236,
      "text": "details on its website."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.48808510638298,
      "end": 57.272127659574465,
      "text": "Bob's agent uses that direct path."
    },
    {
      "start": 57.33914893617022,
      "end": 59.64446808510638,
      "text": "An index lookup isn't needed here."
    },
    {
      "start": 60.01716312056738,
      "end": 63.10971631205675,
      "text": "AgentBox carries Bob's question to Alice."
    },
    {
      "start": 63.18737588652483,
      "end": 66.5390780141844,
      "text": "She checks her inbox and replies, \"We have chocolate and"
    },
    {
      "start": 66.5490780141844,
      "end": 67.65226950354611,
      "text": "vanilla cakes.\""
    },
    {
      "start": 67.80439716312058,
      "end": 70.0990780141844,
      "text": "Bob's agent receives the menu."
    },
    {
      "start": 70.45049645390073,
      "end": 73.51496453900711,
      "text": "Later, after Bob has placed an order and agreed to"
    },
    {
      "start": 73.52496453900712,
      "end": 76.24517730496454,
      "text": "updates, Alice starts a new message."
    },
    {
      "start": 76.32283687943264,
      "end": 79.00049645390072,
      "text": "She asks her agent to tell Bob that his cake"
    },
    {
      "start": 79.07815602836881,
      "end": 79.76645390070924,
      "text": "is ready."
    },
    {
      "start": 80.15049645390073,
      "end": 84.80687943262413,
      "text": "Alice knows Bob's registered ID, bob@gmail.com."
    },
    {
      "start": 84.87390070921988,
      "end": 88.30687943262413,
      "text": "Bob doesn't own gmail.com or need a website."
    },
    {
      "start": 88.42709219858159,
      "end": 91.5021985815603,
      "text": "Her agent asks the index to resolve his ID to"
    },
    {
      "start": 91.5121985815603,
      "end": 93.51964539007093,
      "text": "his hosted agent card."
    },
    {
      "start": 93.88382978723406,
      "end": 97.69297872340428,
      "text": "Alice's agent verifies the link between Bob's ID and his"
    },
    {
      "start": 97.70297872340429,
      "end": 98.27425531914895,
      "text": "card."
    },
    {
      "start": 98.5221276595745,
      "end": 101.80617021276596,
      "text": "The card provides the current endpoint where his agent can"
    },
    {
      "start": 101.85191489361704,
      "end": 102.84872340425534,
      "text": "be contacted."
    },
    {
      "start": 102.9476595744681,
      "end": 105.8912765957447,
      "text": "The sending agent checks the required permissions before"
    },
    {
      "start": 105.92638297872342,
      "end": 106.97638297872344,
      "text": "proceeding."
    },
    {
      "start": 107.35049645390073,
      "end": 110.283475177305,
      "text": "AgentBox delivers the update to Bob."
    },
    {
      "start": 110.35049645390075,
      "end": 114.41496453900712,
      "text": "The index handles identity resolution while AgentBox carries the"
    },
    {
      "start": 114.42496453900712,
      "end": 116.66645390070926,
      "text": "message between their agents."
    },
    {
      "start": 117.0171631205674,
      "end": 120.7731205673759,
      "text": "Bob checks his inbox and replies, \"Thanks, I'll collect it"
    },
    {
      "start": 120.7831205673759,
      "end": 121.62035460992911,
      "text": "at 2 p.m.\""
    },
    {
      "start": 121.97460992907804,
      "end": 126.26929078014186,
      "text": "Alice receives his reply in Muse, completing the exchange."
    },
    {
      "start": 126.6171631205674,
      "end": 128.92248226950358,
      "text": "Both people keep their own apps."
    },
    {
      "start": 129.25546099290784,
      "end": 132.75609929078018,
      "text": "The index connects a known identity to the agent's current"
    },
    {
      "start": 132.76609929078018,
      "end": 137.06078014184402,
      "text": "contact details, including for people who don't control a domain."
    },
    {
      "start": 137.12780141843976,
      "end": 140.2416312056738,
      "text": "Permission still governs every connection."
    },
    {
      "start": 140.58382978723407,
      "end": 142.88914893617024,
      "text": "You can read the matching prompts in the guide."
    },
    {
      "start": 143.13702127659576,
      "end": 145.77595744680855,
      "text": "Open the setup page to connect your own agent and"
    },
    {
      "start": 145.78595744680854,
      "end": 146.83595744680855,
      "text": "try a message."
    }
  ]
}